  "question": "Where can I find hotel inside 20 kilometers as I travel from Top of the Rock, New York, NY toward Speert Green, Wayne, NJ?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.979395 40.759034)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.198768 40.944562)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'hotel'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.979395 40.759034)',4326)::geography, 20000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.979395 40.759034)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
